association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nThe issue I encountered while using code in Godot 4.4:\n\n```gdscript\nvar hBoxContainer := HBoxContainer.new()\nhBoxContainer.set_anchors_preset(LayoutPreset.PRESET_BOTTOM_WIDE)\nself.add_child(hBoxContainer)\nfor i in 4:\n\tvar button := Button.new()\n\tbutton.name = \"button\" + str(i + 1)\n\tbutton.text = \"text\"\n\tbutton.size_flags_horizontal = Control.SIZE_EXPAND_FILL\n\tbutton.set(\"theme_override_font_sizes/font_size\", 80)\n\thBoxContainer.add_child(button)\n```\n\nMy canvas size is 1080×1920. After the project starts, the `position.y` of the `HBoxContainer` node is 1920. However, if I create the node manually instead of using code and set the `PRESET_BOTTOM_WIDE` in the Inspector, the `position.y` is 1800, which is correct and what I want. How can I achieve this using code?\n\n**My solution is:**\n\n```gdscript\nvar hBoxContainer := HBoxContainer.new()\nhBoxContainer.ready.connect(\n    func():\n        hBoxContainer.set_anchors_preset(LayoutPreset.PRESET_BOTTOM_WIDE)\n        hBoxContainer.position.y -= hBoxContainer.size.y\n)\nself.add_child(hBoxContainer)\n```\n\n### System information\n\nwin10\n\n### Issue description\n\n-\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n -\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n -","closed_by":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{